<p>As you learn to tiptoe across the veil of death you learn to master the dark forces.</p><p>Each time you cross the 1 life threshold you automatically unleash a blast of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">159, 214, 257, 293, 325</acronym> frostdusk damage in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 3, 4, 4, 5.</acronym></p><p>For each creature that takes damage from the blast one of your talent's cooldown is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>